{"lyrics":"[00:00.42] Southside on the track, yeah\n[00:16.70] Damn, mayday, mayday, I need backup\n[00:20.32] She broke my heart, that bitch a slasher\n[00:23.64] In the meantime, I been running the racks up\n[00:27.06] In the lean-time, I been pourin' that Act' up\n[00:30.82] Mayday, mayday, I need backup\n[00:34.00] She broke my heart, the bitch a slasher\n[00:36.94] In the meantime, I'll be running the racks up\n[00:40.76] In the lean-time, I'll be pourin' that Act' up\n[00:43.66] She turned me to an Actavis activist\n[00:46.86] She told me that she broke my heart on accident\n[00:50.32] We Californicate, and that's my residence\n[00:53.76] I'm turnin' into Satan, kill the evidence\n[00:57.30] I fall in love easy, that shit evident\n[01:00.56] I'm taking codeine with all my medicine\n[01:03.98] She doing morphine to numb the pain again\n[01:07.70] Feeling like Prince with Purple Rain again\n[01:10.88] I say the right things at the wrong times\n[01:14.32] Her head's fucked up, snort the wrong lines\n[01:17.76] Remember when you said you were all mine?\n[01:21.82] All mine turned to all lies\n[01:25.30] Damn, mayday, mayday, I need backup\n[01:28.88] She broke my heart, that bitch a slasher\n[01:32.16] In the meantime, I been running the racks up\n[01:35.62] In the lean-time, I been pourin' that Act' up\n[01:39.38] Mayday, mayday, I need backup\n[01:42.56] She broke my heart, the bitch a slasher\n[01:45.84] In the meantime, I'll be running the racks up\n[01:49.32] In the lean-time, I'll be pourin' that Act' up\n[01:52.90] Damn, mayday, mayday, I need two cups\n[01:56.42] I get so damn high, I don't feel much\n[01:59.48] I say, \"Kids, do drugs,\" but don't do too much\n[02:02.88] Last time I heard that, I did too much\n[02:06.36] Too much isn't enough, I'm not giving a fuck\n[02:09.62] I'm done believing in love, yeah, I'm giving it up\n[02:13.14] I fell in love with the lean, shit be slowin' me up\n[02:16.46] But keep on pourin' me up until the pain numbs me\n[02